WEBVTT

1
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:35.580
CHEAP APARTMENTS AVAILABLE

2
00:00:43.293 --> 00:00:44.293
ALMORE CONVENT

3
00:00:44.336 --> 00:00:46.064
You're a bloody fool!
Your father's father is a bloody fool.

4
00:00:46.088 --> 00:00:47.440
Your father is an ass!

5
00:00:47.506 --> 00:00:48.423
You are an ass, you idiot!

6
00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:50.580
You're the world's biggest lizard,
you idiot!

7
00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:52.427
You're a dog! Your father is a dog!

8
00:00:52.511 --> 00:00:54.304
You are a mad dog!

9
00:00:54.388 --> 00:00:59.260
Your mother is a bloody fool,
your father is a bloody fool.

10
00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.244
<i>Love rebels</i>

11
00:01:17.828 --> 00:01:20.122
<i>Love rebels</i>

12
00:01:22.416 --> 00:01:25.169
