13
00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:33.552
<i>These birds of bedlam
Love-rebels</i>

14
00:01:33.886 --> 00:01:37.806
<i>They'll snipe your heart
Love-rebels</i>

15
00:01:40.058 --> 00:01:46.023
<i>They're twitching Love-rebels</i>

16
00:01:46.190 --> 00:01:51.540
<i>To take this love apart
Love-rebels</i>

17
00:01:51.612 --> 00:01:53.030
<i>Among the lawful</i>

18
