<i>In poets renditions</i>

30
00:02:16.470 --> 00:02:17.804
<i>Love-rebels</i>

31
00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:19.598
<i>The Love rebels</i>

32
00:02:19.681 --> 00:02:22.851
<i>Where are they now?</i>

33
00:02:35.364 --> 00:02:41.328
<i>Not of the earth nor of the sky</i>

34
00:02:41.411 --> 00:02:47.251
<i>Infinite unto themselves
The Love rebels...</i>

35
00:02:47.334 --> 00:02:48.752
<i>Among the lawful</i>

36
00:02:48.836 --> 00:02:50.337
<i>And the lawless</i>

37
