<i>Those that were</i>

38
00:02:51.839 --> 00:02:53.382
<i>Among the thousands</i>

39
00:02:53.465 --> 00:02:54.967
<i>Love-rebels</i>

40
00:02:55.050 --> 00:02:56.677
<i>The Love rebels</i>

41
00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.721
<i>Where are they now?</i>

42
00:02:59.805 --> 00:03:01.265
<i>Among the stars</i>

43
00:03:01.348 --> 00:03:02.683
<i>Among the legends</i>

44
00:03:02.766 --> 00:03:04.351
<i>Those that were found</i>

45
00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:05.853
<i>In poets renditions</i>

46
00:03:05.936 --> 00:03:07.312
<i>Love-rebels</i>

47
00:03:07.396 --> 00:03:08.814
<i>The Love rebels</i>

48
00:03:08.897 --> 00:03:12.568
<i>Where are they now?</i>

49
00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:28.417
<i>Chand's body is an atom bomb!
Chand's figure is killing!</i>

50
00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:45.184
Malti!

51
00:03:53.442 --> 00:03:55.400
Get me some diesel, ten cans.

52
00:03:55.485 --> 00:03:57.360
The market's not doing too well.

53
00:03:57.613 --> 00:04:00.640
I don't have ten cans,
there's only one left.

54
00:04:00.741 --> 00:04:01.783
Don't make me thrash you!

55
00:04:01.867 --> 00:04:04.040
It's his <i>Dadda</i>
birthday party tonight,

56
00:04:04.286 --> 00:04:06.681
the whole place has to be lit up,
the generator has to run all night.

57
00:04:06.705 --> 00:04:08.705
Are you going to make
Chand Baby dance in the dark?

58
00:04:09.458 --> 00:04:10.667
They were here earlier,

59
00:04:10.751 --> 00:04:12.353
they've paid in advance
for ten cans of diesel

60
00:04:12.377 --> 00:04:13.605
they'll be back any minute
to pick it up.

61
00:04:13.629 --> 00:04:15.589
Who has paid the advance, damn it?

62
00:04:21.929 --> 00:04:24.780
MLA Qureshi's men. They have
a party tonight as well...

63
00:04:25.516 --> 00:04:28.060
There goes law and order.

64
00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.120
BOLD

65
00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:35.260
Party, is it?

66
00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:37.736
Have you been invited
to do a cabaret?

67
00:04:39.530 --> 00:04:41.615
Dear Lala, you do know that,

68
00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:44.315
Qureshi will remain in power
only for a few more days...

69
00:04:45.369 --> 00:04:49.373
soon Dadda will win the elections,
so why do you want to mess with me?

70
00:04:49.623 --> 00:04:52.626
Please try and understand Parma sir,
if I give you all the ten cans,

71
00:04:52.918 --> 00:04:56.922
they'll kill me, why don't
you share amongst yourselves.

72
00:04:57.047 --> 00:04:59.591
Qureshis and Chauhans, share?

73
00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:01.426
Have you gone mad?

74
00:05:01.552 --> 00:05:05.764
Why not share, anything's possible.

75
00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:10.936
Kantilala, it says no smoking!

76
00:05:11.144 --> 00:05:13.188
You take six cans I'll give them five.

77
00:05:13.605 --> 00:05:17.693
OK, take seven, eight, all!
You take them all!

78
00:05:19.111 --> 00:05:20.279
Thank you.

79
00:05:28.495 --> 00:05:29.621
Come on Dance!

80
00:05:29.705 --> 00:05:30.998
Take the diesel, let's leave!

81
00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:36.003
The Qureshi's will be here any minute,
if you could hurry please,

82
00:05:36.170 --> 00:05:38.839
why get into unwanted brawls.
I am saying it for your own good.

83
00:05:40.716 --> 00:05:41.550
For my good?

84
00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.100
Do it, do it...

85
00:05:44.469 --> 00:05:46.430
Stop! What do you
think you're doing...

86
00:05:49.725 --> 00:05:51.101
Parma, seriously?!

87
00:06:09.494 --> 00:06:13.498
Always remember Kanti, no smoking!!

88
00:06:13.582 --> 00:06:16.001
He did give you the diesel,
then why unnecessarily...

89
00:06:16.084 --> 00:06:18.128
To teach him a lesson!

90
00:06:18.212 --> 00:06:20.339
This time I've only turned
his warehouse into an oven

91
00:06:20.422 --> 00:06:22.341
but in future if he favors the Qureshi's,

92
00:06:22.424 --> 00:06:24.301
I'll turn it into his graveyard!

93
00:06:24.384 --> 00:06:25.844
Die traitor! Die!

94
00:06:31.975 --> 00:06:36.688
Qureshi sir owns the best guns,
some even imported.

95
00:06:37.231 --> 00:06:40.234
Yeah! But I rarely
get to touch <i>Dad's </i>guns.

96
00:06:41.193 --> 00:06:42.528
This one will be mine.

97
00:06:42.778 --> 00:06:45.280
You should buy a sling to aim
at raw mangoes instead.

98
00:06:46.031 --> 00:06:47.431
Who is going to aim at raw mangoes?

99
00:06:48.158 --> 00:06:50.278
I'm going to blast the heads
of those bloody Chauhans.

100
00:06:50.369 --> 00:06:52.287
Yes, you blast their heads
and they blast yours.

101
00:06:52.496 --> 00:06:53.976
But it's us commoners who will bleed.

102
00:06:57.584 --> 00:06:58.752
How much?

103
00:06:58.836 --> 00:06:59.670
Rs.20,000.

104
00:06:59.753 --> 00:07:00.838
Rs.20,000?

105
00:07:00.921 --> 00:07:04.091
This is a copy, made locally,
that's why only Rs.20,000.

106
00:07:04.299 --> 00:07:06.468
The original is for Rs.300,000

107
00:07:13.141 --> 00:07:16.019
Here's Rs.8,000, remaining Rs.12,000,
you'll get it on Eid festival.

108
00:07:17.145 --> 00:07:19.105
Pay the full amount
and only then you get the gun.

109
00:07:19.273 --> 00:07:20.858
Don't you mess with an MLA's daughter!

110
00:07:21.024 --> 00:07:23.464
Or should I just call up father,
and he will set you straight!

111
00:07:29.533 --> 00:07:33.745
Go ahead, call him!

112
00:07:40.836 --> 00:07:44.840
Gold earrings, real gold.
We're even now!

113
00:07:49.094 --> 00:07:50.679
Don't you want the bullets?

114
00:07:57.769 --> 00:07:59.249
Why wouldn't I not want the bullets?!

115
00:08:12.367 --> 00:08:14.119
Where were you?

116
00:08:14.203 --> 00:08:16.914
Your mom has called six times,
didn't you hear the phone ring?

117
00:08:17.289 --> 00:08:19.625
It's so noisy out here,
can't even hear gunshot!

118
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:20.708
Really!

119
00:08:22.211 --> 00:08:25.464
Hi Mom, heading home now.

120
00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:30.177
Are you serious, you expect me
to bunk college and go buy the earrings?

121
00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:32.179
And who'd make up
for my attendance

122
00:08:32.262 --> 00:08:35.933
you, the jeweler,
or Javed's mother?

123
00:08:36.808 --> 00:08:38.977
Anyway, when's dad going
to file his nomination papers?

124
00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.230
He's done it already?

125
00:08:41.813 --> 00:08:46.610
Without me! I told him a hundred times
that I wanted to come along.

126
00:08:47.444 --> 00:08:51.907
I don't want to hear anything,
you tell him he's in trouble.

127
00:08:52.282 --> 00:08:54.493
I'll teach him a lesson.

128
00:08:56.912 --> 00:08:58.789
Damn it! He has filed
the papers without me.

129
00:08:59.331 --> 00:09:01.208
OK, calm down now
and show me the earrings.

130
00:09:02.209 --> 00:09:03.418
Earrings?

131
00:09:11.343 --> 00:09:13.220
Go on, fire away.
It's loaded.

132
00:09:14.346 --> 00:09:15.556
And the earrings?

133
00:09:16.390 --> 00:09:18.809
I traded the earrings for this.

134
00:09:18.976 --> 00:09:20.656
So what are you going
to wear this evening?

135
00:09:20.853 --> 00:09:23.230
Now the party
is for dad contesting the elections.

136
00:09:23.313 --> 00:09:25.774
The sparkle of my earrings
won't win him any extra votes,

137
00:09:25.858 --> 00:09:27.442
as for Mr. Javed,

138
00:09:27.568 --> 00:09:32.906
if he doesn't like my pretty face
without fancy earrings,

139
00:09:33.031 --> 00:09:37.578
then he may as well marry
a jeweler and go to hell!

140
00:09:38.787 --> 00:09:40.497
That's exactly what he'll do.

141
00:09:40.664 --> 00:09:42.332
Come on old man, make way!

142
00:09:42.583 --> 00:09:45.669
You will end up in the hospital,
and I'll have to deal with the mess.

143
00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:46.860
AFTAB QURESHI

144
00:09:46.962 --> 00:09:48.380
The Qureshi lineage starts here.

145
00:09:48.755 --> 00:09:53.343
These are Zoya's grand-parents.
God bless their soul.

146
00:09:54.094 --> 00:09:58.807
My eldest sister and her husband,
I mean, your uncle-in-law.

147
00:09:59.266 --> 00:10:00.475
Greetings!

148
00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:01.768
His three sons.

149
00:10:02.186 --> 00:10:03.353
Greetings!

150
00:10:04.021 --> 00:10:05.189
Greetings!

151
00:10:06.273 --> 00:10:09.651
Mehtab, my younger brother.
Your uncle.

152
00:10:09.818 --> 00:10:10.818
Greetings!

153
00:10:10.944 --> 00:10:12.571
His two sons, Sohraab...

154
00:10:12.821 --> 00:10:13.821
Greetings!

155
00:10:13.906 --> 00:10:14.906
and Shadaab.

156
00:10:14.948 --> 00:10:15.948
Greetings!

157
00:10:16.658 --> 00:10:20.162
This is me, your mom-in-law
and this is our Zoya.

158
00:10:20.704 --> 00:10:21.830
Dad!

159
00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:24.249
Here comes Ms. Earthquake.

160
00:10:28.879 --> 00:10:30.297
Hello.
Dad!

161
00:10:30.380 --> 00:10:32.049
Where did you graduate from?

162
00:10:32.216 --> 00:10:33.675
London School of Medical Science.

163
00:10:34.301 --> 00:10:36.261
Greetings!

164
00:10:37.554 --> 00:10:38.555
Hello!

165
00:10:38.847 --> 00:10:39.847
Hello!

166
00:10:39.890 --> 00:10:41.808
Dad! This is not done!

167
00:10:41.975 --> 00:10:43.227
What have I done?

168
00:10:43.393 --> 00:10:46.313
I'm only showing the family tree
you made to Javed.

169
00:10:46.563 --> 00:10:49.191
Very nice tree.
Is arts and craft your hobby?

170
00:10:49.691 --> 00:10:52.486
It was. Eight years ago,
back in my seventh grade.

171
00:10:52.694 --> 00:10:54.530
Now my hobby is hunting. OK?

172
00:10:55.405 --> 00:10:57.217
Why didn't you take me
along to file the papers?

173
00:10:57.241 --> 00:10:58.921
What would you have done
in all that chaos?

174
00:10:58.951 --> 00:11:00.244
I took your brothers along.

175
00:11:01.286 --> 00:11:03.366
Fine! Then ask them to get
you all the votes as well.

176
00:11:03.455 --> 00:11:05.624
You won't get a single vote
from my college now.

177
00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:07.459
We'll get him the votes.

178
00:11:08.335 --> 00:11:09.813
Now you know Javed,
how she threatens me.

179
00:11:09.837 --> 00:11:12.005
Zoya! How could you come
here looking all shabby.

180
00:11:12.172 --> 00:11:13.590
Come on, lets go.

181
00:11:13.674 --> 00:11:15.759
I'm not even going to attend
the party tonight!

182
00:11:15.926 --> 00:11:17.636
No one is going to let you,
in these rags.

183
00:11:17.719 --> 00:11:19.680
That's my waistcoat you're calling a rag.

184
00:11:20.013 --> 00:11:24.142
Zoya gets my old worn out waistcoats
altered and wears them.

185
00:11:24.434 --> 00:11:26.895
How often have I asked her to get herself
a new one?

186
00:11:27.271 --> 00:11:28.981
That's how stubborn Zoya is.

187
00:11:29.064 --> 00:11:30.774
No gun or canon can shake her.

188
00:11:31.358 --> 00:11:33.569
You be careful, dear Javed...

189
00:11:34.027 --> 00:11:35.988
don't ever hurt her...

190
00:11:36.780 --> 00:11:38.490
or else this family army of mine...

191
00:11:39.783 --> 00:11:41.326
will surely kill you.

192
00:11:42.953 --> 00:11:44.621
Not a joke. We're serious.

193
00:11:44.788 --> 00:11:48.375
We will kill anyone, who hurts Zoya.

194
00:11:49.459 --> 00:11:51.837
Understood?

195
00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.940
<i>Rogue, your love is a rogue, by joke!</i>

196
00:11:58.040 --> 00:12:00.800
<i>Your hero is a rogue</i>

197
00:12:00.888 --> 00:12:04.975
<i>Chand's body is an atom bomb!
Chand's figure is killing!</i>

198
00:12:11.315 --> 00:12:13.609
<i>Chand your body is like a cell phone</i>

199
00:12:13.775 --> 00:12:16.445
<i>Oh baby, make me its ring tone</i>

200
00:12:16.528 --> 00:12:18.322
Hail Hanuman!

201
00:12:25.287 --> 00:12:27.497
Was Kanti's warehouse overflowing
with diesel?

202
00:12:27.581 --> 00:12:29.917
<i>Dadda </i>had asked for only six cans,
I picked up ten!

203
00:12:30.125 --> 00:12:31.793
Parma! Come up now.

204
00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.840
Hang on Mom,
Dadda's been asking for the diesel.

205
00:12:33.921 --> 00:12:35.172
I have to talk to you first.

206
00:12:35.589 --> 00:12:37.758
Alright! I am coming.

207
00:12:43.305 --> 00:12:45.182
Mom, you're prayers have been answered.

208
00:12:45.265 --> 00:12:46.493
I've finally made Dadda happy today.

209
00:12:46.517 --> 00:12:48.560
If my prayers were answered,
I'd be dead by now!

210
00:12:48.727 --> 00:12:49.770
What nonsense!

211
00:12:49.853 --> 00:12:51.605
I've always prayed that
you never follow

212
00:12:51.688 --> 00:12:52.968
in your grandfather's footsteps.

213
00:12:53.065 --> 00:12:54.983
And if you do,
God should kill me before that.

214
00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:58.612
- You've outdone your grandfather.
- Obviously.

215
00:12:59.196 --> 00:13:01.031
Sadly, I'm still alive.

216
00:13:01.698 --> 00:13:03.134
You have no idea what happened today?

217
00:13:03.158 --> 00:13:04.284
Say sorry.

218
00:13:04.368 --> 00:13:05.368
To whom?

219
00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.662
Say sorry to them.

220
00:13:07.829 --> 00:13:09.122
Who is them?

221
00:13:14.044 --> 00:13:16.588
You're kidding me?
You couldn't find anyone else?

222
00:13:18.632 --> 00:13:20.467
Give them this money for their losses.

223
00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:22.177
- Mom, now this is...
- Parme!

224
00:13:30.519 --> 00:13:31.436
Take this...

225
00:13:31.520 --> 00:13:33.313
- No, Parma bro...
- I insist!

226
00:13:34.231 --> 00:13:35.791
- Now give it to me.
- No, really it's OK.

227
00:13:38.235 --> 00:13:40.279
Give me your damn forgiveness!

228
00:13:40.487 --> 00:13:42.155
- Give or else...
- Given, sir given.

229
00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:47.828
And Kanti, next time you come crying
to Mom, I'll bloody...

230
00:13:47.911 --> 00:13:50.080
Parma! Your language is disgusting.

231
00:13:50.747 --> 00:13:52.332
What else am I supposed to say?

232
00:13:52.666 --> 00:13:54.001
Dadda got him his license,

233
00:13:54.168 --> 00:13:55.895
and he's busy making money selling oil
to the enemy.

234
00:13:55.919 --> 00:13:59.339
So in lieu of the license you'll burn
his warehouse?

235
00:13:59.798 --> 00:14:01.425
What a team you are,
grandfather and son.

236
00:14:01.508 --> 00:14:03.886
Yes, I am! I'm proud
of being Surya Chauhan's grandson.

237
00:14:03.969 --> 00:14:05.721
That's why I managed to get the diesel,

238
00:14:05.804 --> 00:14:07.806
else tonight we'd be sitting in darkness

239
00:14:07.890 --> 00:14:10.225
and the Qureshi's
would be celebrating Diwali!

240
00:14:12.102 --> 00:14:14.730
Kanti you jerk,
once the elections are over,

241
00:14:14.813 --> 00:14:16.982
I'll make sure your license gets
cancelled...

242
00:14:17.149 --> 00:14:19.735
So?
Serves you right!

243
00:14:19.818 --> 00:14:22.321
Your entire family should've burnt

244
00:14:22.654 --> 00:14:24.656
You know we will win,

245
00:14:25.115 --> 00:14:27.993
if I don't get your house raided,
I'll change my name.

246
00:14:28.202 --> 00:14:29.328
Call Aggarwal.

247
00:14:29.411 --> 00:14:31.222
He is expensive but at least
he'll guarantee delivery.

248
00:14:31.246 --> 00:14:32.246
What happened?

249
00:14:32.289 --> 00:14:33.975
Those bloody dogs Chauhans,
they took away our diesel.

250
00:14:33.999 --> 00:14:37.044
Get your guns out and let's get
our diesel back from the rascals.

251
00:14:37.169 --> 00:14:39.338
Why not!
They're just waiting right now.

252
00:14:39.546 --> 00:14:41.381
Oh Zoya! Please come,
take back what's yours.

253
00:14:41.465 --> 00:14:43.825
- Listen! All I'm saying...
- Mind your own business. Let's go.

254
00:14:43.926 --> 00:14:47.179
We'll deal with it.
You just calm down.

255
00:14:47.471 --> 00:14:48.639
Hello? Aggarwal...

256
00:14:48.722 --> 00:14:50.474
Those rascals stole our diesel, Mom.

257
00:14:50.557 --> 00:14:51.576
What's your father there for.?

258
00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.353
He'll pour the very same diesel
on their house and set it on fire.

259
00:14:58.524 --> 00:15:00.817
My naughty Mom!

260
00:15:00.901 --> 00:15:03.046
Are you just going to make me slog?
Won't you feed me anything?

261
00:15:03.070 --> 00:15:05.831
Get the damn thing started.
I'll treat you to a full tandoori chicken.

262
00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.075
Hail tandoori chicken!

263
00:15:08.367 --> 00:15:11.537
Tandoori! Tandoori! Tandoori!

264
00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:15.040
C'mon. C'mon. C'mon.

265
00:15:15.374 --> 00:15:17.960
The whiskey goes inside,
ask me before serving it.

266
00:15:18.335 --> 00:15:20.504
Only beer to the party workers.

267
00:15:21.463 --> 00:15:23.507
I clearly said strong beer,

268
00:15:23.757 --> 00:15:25.551
these drunkards don't understand
light beers.

269
00:15:26.718 --> 00:15:28.637
What's up with these bloody lights?

270
00:15:29.263 --> 00:15:30.863
Has the generator's sister gotten raped?

271
00:15:31.056 --> 00:15:32.307
Why is it dying out like this?

272
00:15:32.474 --> 00:15:34.351
Parma! Hurry up with that thing,

273
00:15:34.434 --> 00:15:37.312
before Dadda fires
a double barrel up your sorry bum.

274
00:15:37.563 --> 00:15:39.439
This is a household driven by men.

275
00:15:39.648 --> 00:15:42.150
A household driven by men,
that talks like a man.

276
00:15:42.484 --> 00:15:44.504
Looks like Chand will actually end up
dancing in the dark.

277
00:15:44.528 --> 00:15:45.988
Show the generator some love.

278
00:15:46.071 --> 00:15:48.191
I'm telling you Kanti sold us water
instead of diesel.

279
00:15:48.365 --> 00:15:50.158
My oldest daughter-in-law died of dengue.

280
00:15:50.325 --> 00:15:52.494
The only family now remaining is me,
my son,

281
00:15:52.619 --> 00:15:54.288
my grandsons Dharma, Karma

282
00:15:54.371 --> 00:15:56.081
and Parma.

283
00:15:56.164 --> 00:15:58.166
His father died in an accident.

284
00:15:58.333 --> 00:16:01.003
But I've given my son's widow
and her son a room upstairs,

285
00:16:01.170 --> 00:16:03.250
I even give them money
for their monthly expenditure.

286
00:16:03.338 --> 00:16:06.175
Anyway, why are you in such a hurry?
Stay a while.

287
00:16:06.258 --> 00:16:07.676
It's the election pressure.

288
00:16:07.885 --> 00:16:09.803
I thought I'd personally request you,

289
00:16:10.053 --> 00:16:11.906
to co-operate in carrying out
the election peacefully.

290
00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:14.600
Almore has a very bad reputation
when it comes to elections

291
00:16:14.850 --> 00:16:17.436
and we should avoid any riots this time.

292
00:16:17.686 --> 00:16:22.983
Listen, if any of my party-men
break the law,

293
00:16:23.192 --> 00:16:25.444
I'll personally bring them to you.

294
00:16:25.527 --> 00:16:28.238
You can jail them
or hang them if you want.

295
00:16:28.405 --> 00:16:30.216
I guarantee that none of the Chauhans
will misbehave,

296
00:16:30.240 --> 00:16:32.409
but you need to warn the Qureshis, too.

297
00:16:32.618 --> 00:16:35.829
If they cross the line, then my men
will not just sit back and take it,

298
00:16:36.038 --> 00:16:37.432
like I said, this is a household of men.

299
00:16:37.456 --> 00:16:40.167
I've just met the Qureshis as well,
Mr Aftab has promised to...

300
00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:44.046
That's it! If Mister Aftab behaves
then it will be all peace and quiet.

301
00:16:44.129 --> 00:16:47.633
My clan, we're all Gandhi-disciples.

302
00:16:48.175 --> 00:16:50.195
If Mr. Aftaab has promised,
I give you the mother of all promises.

303
00:16:50.219 --> 00:16:51.762
We're done here! Good night!

304
00:16:53.263 --> 00:16:55.366
What's happening with these damn lights?
Can somebody look into it?

305
00:16:55.390 --> 00:16:57.851
Parma! Have you eloped
with the damn generator's sister?

306
00:16:58.268 --> 00:17:00.521
- Hurry up and fix it!
- Yeah! I'm doing it.

307
00:17:00.729 --> 00:17:02.123
Just do one thing right.
Just one thing.

308
00:17:02.147 --> 00:17:03.732
C'mon start it in the name of Chand.

309
00:17:07.069 --> 00:17:12.616
Chand... Chand... Chand...

310
00:17:15.202 --> 00:17:16.703
There you go.

311
00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:18.515
Even the generator gets turned on
at the mention of Chand.

312
00:17:18.539 --> 00:17:20.791
Drink up... I'll go tell Dadda.

313
00:17:20.874 --> 00:17:24.461
Chand Baby! When is she going to come?

314
00:17:27.130 --> 00:17:30.467
Chauhan sir, is she gonna show up
or we'll have to go away thirsty!

315
00:17:30.551 --> 00:17:32.052
Why isn't the whore here yet?

316
00:17:32.594 --> 00:17:34.954
If she does not show up,
forget about winning the elections.

317
00:17:35.055 --> 00:17:37.724
This lot won't vote for me
until they've had their fill

318
00:17:37.808 --> 00:17:41.270
of Chand's moves and imported alcohol.

319
00:17:41.395 --> 00:17:42.938
The generator's started Dadda,

320
00:17:43.021 --> 00:17:44.581
now you needn't worry about the lights.

321
00:17:44.648 --> 00:17:45.708
Did you get through to her?

322
00:17:45.732 --> 00:17:47.627
Chand's not picking up,
neither is anyone at the brothel.

323
00:17:47.651 --> 00:17:48.962
Who'd gone to book Chand
for this evening?

324
00:17:48.986 --> 00:17:50.153
Parma!

325
00:17:50.237 --> 00:17:51.697
Where do you think you're going?

326
00:17:51.905 --> 00:17:53.505
Once again you've managed to mess it up.

327
00:17:53.532 --> 00:17:55.012
I'd fixed the date, time, everything.

328
00:17:55.158 --> 00:17:56.845
- Did you pay the advance?
- Yes, did that too.

329
00:17:56.869 --> 00:17:58.787
Did she buy her coffin with that money?

330
00:17:58.912 --> 00:18:00.390
I'll go right away
and drag her here by her plait.

331
00:18:00.414 --> 00:18:04.084
At least do one thing right.
Just one thing.

332
00:18:04.251 --> 00:18:05.251
Don't worry, Dadda.

333
00:18:05.294 --> 00:18:07.054
Chand will definitely dance at
your birthday.

334
00:18:07.504 --> 00:18:09.882
Idiots! I was drunk,
but why didn't you stop me?

335
00:18:09.965 --> 00:18:11.592
It's not like we were on a pilgrimage.

336
00:18:11.675 --> 00:18:13.875
Plus you didn't tell us
the money was for the advance...

337
00:18:13.969 --> 00:18:16.096
But that was one
crazy party that night!

338
00:18:16.180 --> 00:18:18.324
Now if we don't get Baby back,
it'll be one bloody funeral tonight!

339
00:18:18.348 --> 00:18:20.535
Where's she going to go?
You were itching for a hunt right?

340
00:18:20.559 --> 00:18:22.227
C'mon, lets hunt.

341
00:18:53.175 --> 00:18:58.388
<i>She hurts like a bullet</i>

342
00:19:02.434 --> 00:19:08.273
<i>She bursts like a bomb</i>

343
00:19:15.489 --> 00:19:19.201
<i>Lovers beware</i>

344
00:19:19.493 --> 00:19:24.373
<i>She's the dynamite doll</i>

345
00:19:26.542 --> 00:19:30.462
<i>Chand baby is it</i>

346
00:19:33.340 --> 00:19:36.760
<i>Or the end of the world?</i>

347
00:19:55.571 --> 00:19:59.825
<i>The Titanic of all lovers</i>

348
00:20:00.784 --> 00:20:05.163
<i>The Titanic of all lovers</i>

349
00:20:05.247 --> 00:20:10.752
<i>Took me to sea and took me down</i>

350
00:20:10.836 --> 00:20:14.298
<i>My love, my rogue, by joke!</i>

351
00:20:20.721 --> 00:20:25.350
<i>I thought he was the golden boy</i>

352
00:20:25.684 --> 00:20:30.522
<i>Yes I thought he was the golden boy</i>

353
00:20:30.606 --> 00:20:35.986
<i>That cheap man got a kiss out of me
With a mere movie in return</i>

354
00:20:36.069 --> 00:20:39.448
<i>My love, my rogue, by joke!</i>

355
00:21:07.893 --> 00:21:13.815
<i>I died in his arms last night</i>

356
00:21:15.192 --> 00:21:20.656
<i>Yes, I died in his arms last night</i>

357
00:21:21.198 --> 00:21:26.161
<i>And the rascal flew away by dawn</i>

358
00:21:26.245 --> 00:21:31.083
<i>I thought he was the teacher of love</i>

359
00:21:31.291 --> 00:21:36.630
<i>The disaster
Failed in the first lesson of love</i>

360
00:21:36.839 --> 00:21:41.009
<i>He thinks he's a dude</i>

361
00:21:41.093 --> 00:21:46.223
<i>In fact he is a kid</i>

362
00:21:46.849 --> 00:21:50.978
<i>I stay awake My heart's at stake</i>

363
00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:56.567
<i>And he snores away the night!</i>

364
00:21:56.859 --> 00:22:00.237
<i>My rogue, my love, by joke!</i>

365
00:22:17.004 --> 00:22:19.506
<i>My sweetheart by joke</i>

366
00:22:19.756 --> 00:22:22.509
<i>My rogue, by joke</i>

367
00:22:22.593 --> 00:22:25.179
<i>Hero, lover, rogue, by joke</i>

368
00:22:25.262 --> 00:22:28.015
<i>My rogue lover, by joke!</i>

369
00:22:43.960 --> 00:22:45.520
Rama, hurry up.

370
00:22:46.116 --> 00:22:47.220
No one moves from here.

371
00:22:47.720 --> 00:22:49.360
Sit, sit. Hey, sit down.

372
00:23:03.342 --> 00:23:04.343
Mom help!

373
00:23:04.426 --> 00:23:05.969
- Shut up!
- You shut up!

374
00:23:06.220 --> 00:23:09.223
Who the hell are you to barge into
our house and ask us to shut up?

375
00:23:09.473 --> 00:23:10.909
I won't even take a piss at your house.

376
00:23:10.933 --> 00:23:12.410
Chand is ours, we've come to take her.

377
00:23:12.434 --> 00:23:14.102
Hey, you accompanists!

378
00:23:14.478 --> 00:23:16.480
C'mon get up.

379
00:23:16.647 --> 00:23:18.357
And you Chand!
Hold my waist and sit tight.

380
00:23:18.649 --> 00:23:19.649
Let's go!

381
00:23:21.777 --> 00:23:24.488
Move aside, you lizard!

382
00:23:24.571 --> 00:23:26.731
You scoundrel! How dare you point
a gun at my daughter!

383
00:23:26.782 --> 00:23:27.782
Oh shut up!

384
00:23:45.551 --> 00:23:49.388
Shadaab, lets go after them.
Get the jeep out!

385
00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:53.100
Catch them before they cross
the railway-line and thrash them to pulp!

386
00:23:55.143 --> 00:23:56.311
Zoya! You stay home.

387
00:23:56.395 --> 00:23:58.772
He pointed the gun at me
in front of everyone.

388
00:23:59.022 --> 00:24:00.500
So I'm going to be the first one
to slap him.

389
00:24:00.524 --> 00:24:02.684
- And what are we there for?
- Let's not waste time here.

390
00:24:25.841 --> 00:24:27.593
Bikram! Had fun hunting?

391
00:24:27.676 --> 00:24:28.969
Oh yes!

392
00:24:32.347 --> 00:24:33.849
Drive faster!

393
00:24:57.331 --> 00:24:59.791
Chandu, you go straight,
I'll head this way.

394
00:25:03.504 --> 00:25:06.423
Oh yeah!
You want to act smart with me?

395
00:25:34.952 --> 00:25:36.411
Where did that jerk go?

396
00:25:39.414 --> 00:25:40.958
Get that ass!

397
00:25:43.669 --> 00:25:45.003
You bloody ass!

398
00:25:54.555 --> 00:25:55.889
Chand! Watch out!

399
00:25:58.600 --> 00:26:00.936
Go home, Lizard! Loser!

400
00:26:01.395 --> 00:26:02.771
Where are you going?

401
00:26:02.855 --> 00:26:04.791
Loser? You're a loser,
your entire family is a loser.

402
00:26:04.815 --> 00:26:05.917
Where do you think you're going?

403
00:26:05.941 --> 00:26:07.741
I'll come to your house
and kill you, you ass!

404
00:26:07.860 --> 00:26:09.462
Stop! Let him go!
We'll deal with the jerk later!

405
00:26:09.486 --> 00:26:10.696
I'll kill him!

406
00:26:10.779 --> 00:26:11.989
No wait! Let's go!

407
00:26:23.250 --> 00:26:25.127
- Where's Dadda?
- In the room.

408
00:26:26.170 --> 00:26:28.422
You wait here, I'll go get him.

409
00:26:30.132 --> 00:26:31.633
Now simmer down, Collector!

410
00:26:32.092 --> 00:26:33.844
I assure you it won't happen again.

411
00:26:33.927 --> 00:26:35.053
I'll warn him!

412
00:26:35.262 --> 00:26:38.182
Dadda! Didn't I promise,
Chand will dance at your party.

413
00:26:39.016 --> 00:26:40.475
How many shots did you fire?

414
00:26:40.976 --> 00:26:43.187
I didn't really count. Maybe 50 or 75.

415
00:26:43.270 --> 00:26:44.914
For the amount you wasted
on firing bullets,

416
00:26:44.938 --> 00:26:47.441
I would've bought off
ten whores and tied them to a pole.

417
00:26:47.608 --> 00:26:49.318
But Dadda I did it to save your honor...

418
00:26:49.401 --> 00:26:51.081
Had I asked you to kidnap
the bloody whore?

419
00:26:51.236 --> 00:26:52.654
What if there was bloodshed?

420
00:26:53.155 --> 00:26:55.157
The Collector wasn't here
to distribute candies,

421
00:26:55.240 --> 00:26:56.658
he came to warn us.

422
00:26:57.326 --> 00:26:58.869
Did it for my honor, did you?

423
00:26:59.077 --> 00:27:01.038
Your mother already put my honor at stake,

424
00:27:01.121 --> 00:27:02.456
the day she became a widow.

425
00:27:02.998 --> 00:27:05.250
What's Mom's widow-hood
got to do with this?

426
00:27:06.502 --> 00:27:08.822
Your mother destroyed
the one who was supposed to slap you.

427
00:27:09.630 --> 00:27:12.049
No more nuisance till
the elections are over.

428
00:27:12.549 --> 00:27:15.928
The damn Qureshis are not going
to take this lightly.

429
00:27:16.178 --> 00:27:17.489
Should I concentrate on campaigning
for the elections,

430
00:27:17.513 --> 00:27:18.514
or digging their graves?

431
00:27:18.597 --> 00:27:20.516
Let's go Dadda!
Chand's waiting for you.

432
00:27:20.599 --> 00:27:22.559
Don't boil your blood over this moron.

433
00:27:22.935 --> 00:27:25.771
Dadda, you know Chand
won't start without you...

434
00:27:26.772 --> 00:27:28.899
There's not one thing that
this jackass can do right.

435
00:27:29.399 --> 00:27:32.194
Don't you stare back at me!
Don't you dare!

436
00:27:52.089 --> 00:27:54.633
I would've made mince his ass.

437
00:27:54.800 --> 00:27:56.301
Why did you take off with these boys?

438
00:27:56.468 --> 00:27:58.011
He'd pointed a gun at me.

439
00:27:58.095 --> 00:27:59.823
Once they brought the Chauhan boys
back here,

440
00:27:59.847 --> 00:28:01.324
you could have slapped him
a hundred times.

441
00:28:01.348 --> 00:28:03.183
- But Dad...
- Enough! Don't cross the line.

442
00:28:03.517 --> 00:28:06.478
It's hard to find you suitors because
of this dare devil attitude.

443
00:28:06.562 --> 00:28:09.398
Javed was a London educated boy,
he may have tolerated your ways.

444
00:28:09.523 --> 00:28:12.818
I don't want someone to tolerate my ways!
Javed is a wimp.

445
00:28:13.068 --> 00:28:17.489
Parma had a gun pointed at me
and Javed didn't say a word.

446
00:28:18.490 --> 00:28:20.742
I'll marry someone who'll happily take
a bullet for me.

447
00:28:20.826 --> 00:28:22.095
You won't find someone like that.

448
00:28:22.119 --> 00:28:24.955
It's not like I'm dying
to get married either!

449
00:28:25.038 --> 00:28:26.933
So if you don't want to get married,
what do you want to do?

450
00:28:26.957 --> 00:28:28.792
Become an MLA, just like Dad.

451
00:28:31.420 --> 00:28:32.838
Why're you laughing?

452
00:28:32.921 --> 00:28:34.965
- Come inside now.
- She wants to become an MLA.

453
00:28:35.048 --> 00:28:36.860
- Why are you laughing?
- Try Prime Minister instead.

454
00:28:36.884 --> 00:28:40.360
I will become a MLA
and I'll beat the Chauhans

455
00:28:40.429 --> 00:28:41.597
by record margins,

456
00:28:41.722 --> 00:28:44.224
and not just once but 50 times.

457
00:28:44.683 --> 00:28:46.894
Who instilled pride into Almore?

458
00:28:46.977 --> 00:28:51.440
We did it! Our family did it!
Aftab Qureshi did it.

459
00:28:51.815 --> 00:28:55.736
Who installed computers at every school,
college and village?

460
00:28:55.819 --> 00:28:57.738
Aftab Qureshi did.

461
00:28:57.863 --> 00:29:00.949
A computer stands for progress,
no progress - no prosperity.

462
00:29:01.533 --> 00:29:04.578
In the last five years of holding office,
Aftab Qureshi has turned Almore

463
00:29:04.661 --> 00:29:07.414
into a wealthy and opportunity-laden
town.

464
00:29:07.748 --> 00:29:12.544
It's now time to thank
him for his efforts.

465
00:29:12.753 --> 00:29:14.796
To payback for his efforts.

466
00:29:15.297 --> 00:29:18.926
How would you do that?
How can you repay him?

467
00:29:19.009 --> 00:29:23.013
By marking your vote
for the election symbol 'Computer'.

468
00:29:23.096 --> 00:29:25.240
If all our MLAs turn out
to be as hot as her,

469
00:29:25.307 --> 00:29:27.226
the country is sure to progress.

470
00:29:27.309 --> 00:29:29.436
My vote is going in her box.

471
00:29:34.358 --> 00:29:36.693
Don't run! It's just fire-crackers,

472
00:29:36.777 --> 00:29:38.278
not a damn bomb.
Come back or I'll...

473
00:29:38.445 --> 00:29:40.405
Qureshis will lose, this time,

474
00:29:40.489 --> 00:29:42.157
every time, time and again.

475
00:29:42.300 --> 00:29:43.720
Qureshis will lose, this time,

476
00:29:43.909 --> 00:29:45.953
every time, time and again.

477
00:29:47.037 --> 00:29:49.122
Stop this nonsense!

478
00:29:49.206 --> 00:29:50.475
How dare you take off our banners?

479
00:29:50.499 --> 00:29:52.560
The losing Party doesn't get
to put up their banners...

480
00:29:52.584 --> 00:29:55.003
You and your family will lose.

481
00:29:55.087 --> 00:29:56.880
Oh! You think we'll lose?

482
00:29:56.964 --> 00:29:59.091
Who took Chand away from right under
your nose?

483
00:29:59.174 --> 00:30:00.174
We did!

484
00:30:00.217 --> 00:30:02.761
- So, who won?
- We did!

485
00:30:02.845 --> 00:30:03.720
Correct.

486
00:30:03.804 --> 00:30:06.807
- Long live Surya Chauhan!
- Long live! Long live!

487
00:30:07.182 --> 00:30:08.225
Repeat idiots.

488
00:30:08.308 --> 00:30:09.810
Long live Surya Chauhan!

489
00:30:09.893 --> 00:30:12.145
Long live Surya Chauhan!

490
00:30:12.396 --> 00:30:14.064
Down with Surya Chauhan!

491
00:30:14.147 --> 00:30:15.983
Long live Aftab Qureshi!

492
00:30:16.066 --> 00:30:19.152
Down with Aftab Qureshi!

493
00:30:19.236 --> 00:30:20.737
Cow Dung in Surya Chauhan's mouth,

494
00:30:20.821 --> 00:30:22.215
cow dung in his entire families' mouths!

495
00:30:22.239 --> 00:30:23.907
- Cow dung, is it?
- Yeah!

496
00:30:23.991 --> 00:30:25.450
Take this cow dung.

497
00:30:25.534 --> 00:30:27.452
Yeah baby!
Give Qureshi a good shower!

498
00:30:27.536 --> 00:30:30.372
A stream of piss on your dad's face!

499
00:30:30.539 --> 00:30:32.583
A stream of piss on Qureshi's face!

500
00:30:32.708 --> 00:30:35.127
Parma, don't do it.
Don't make matters worse.

501
00:30:35.711 --> 00:30:37.379
Go for it! Shower him!

502
00:30:37.462 --> 00:30:39.506
I'll bathe him in it

503
00:30:39.590 --> 00:30:42.134
and if I meet him,
I'll make him drink it, too.

504
00:30:42.676 --> 00:30:44.136
Let me...

505
00:30:44.219 --> 00:30:46.471
Serve it to him 'on the rocks' baby!

506
00:30:47.264 --> 00:30:50.100
Say Sorry!

507
00:30:51.160 --> 00:30:52.436
Say sorry now!

508
00:30:52.519 --> 00:30:54.521
Parma shoot her!
Don't spare the witch.

509
00:30:55.147 --> 00:30:56.982
Apologize now!

510
00:30:57.065 --> 00:30:59.943
Parma, no! Think of what
your Granddad said! Law and order.

511
00:31:00.319 --> 00:31:01.737
- Say sorry!
- Parma shoot her.

512
00:31:01.820 --> 00:31:03.697
What are you laughing at?
Say sorry!

513
00:31:03.780 --> 00:31:04.865
Parma just fire!

514
00:31:06.116 --> 00:31:07.160
Zoya, run!

515
00:31:07.242 --> 00:31:08.744
She has just insulted you.

516
00:31:08.869 --> 00:31:10.221
We'll take care of
law and order later!

517
00:31:10.245 --> 00:31:12.247
You pull the trigger, shoot her!

518
00:31:29.473 --> 00:31:31.308
She's not going to college from tomorrow.

519
00:31:32.017 --> 00:31:33.602
Get her a tutor.

520
00:31:33.685 --> 00:31:34.829
If she doesn't want to study sitting
at home

521
00:31:34.853 --> 00:31:35.979
let her not study at all!

522
00:31:37.189 --> 00:31:39.024
Dad he misbehaved.

523
00:31:39.107 --> 00:31:41.318
You should've told us,
we'd cut him to size.

524
00:31:41.401 --> 00:31:42.486
Then do it!

525
00:31:42.694 --> 00:31:43.987
What good is just one slap?

526
00:31:44.071 --> 00:31:45.071
Zoya!

527
00:31:45.447 --> 00:31:47.407
Muslim votes alone are not enough to win.

528
00:31:47.950 --> 00:31:49.710
If we draw swords with
the Chauhans right now

529
00:31:49.785 --> 00:31:52.454
the Hindus currently supporting us,
will change sides.

530
00:31:52.538 --> 00:31:53.789
You don't understand this!

531
00:31:53.956 --> 00:31:56.291
Look, you do what you have to...

532
00:31:56.750 --> 00:31:59.229
but she's not going to college
from tomorrow and that's final!

533
00:31:59.253 --> 00:32:00.796
If I stop going to college

534
00:32:00.879 --> 00:32:02.999
won't they think that
they've managed to scare us off.

535
00:32:03.549 --> 00:32:06.093
It's all politics Mom,
you won't understand, right Dad?

536
00:32:07.427 --> 00:32:09.638
You learn to control your anger.

537
00:32:11.098 --> 00:32:12.266
OK. Sure.

538
00:32:17.813 --> 00:32:19.457
The Qureshis are also going
to Mirzapur tomorrow.

539
00:32:19.481 --> 00:32:20.607
So? Are we scared of them?

540
00:32:20.774 --> 00:32:22.317
He's right!

541
00:32:22.484 --> 00:32:23.986
Learn the ropes of politics from him.

542
00:32:24.319 --> 00:32:26.405
Mirzapur is a Muslim dominated town...

543
00:32:26.780 --> 00:32:27.980
if we hold a rally tomorrow

544
00:32:28.031 --> 00:32:30.242
we risk a minuscule turnout
and will look like fools.

545
00:32:31.243 --> 00:32:34.496
Cancel Mirzapur,
but don't let the day go to waste.

546
00:32:34.872 --> 00:32:36.874
So let's conduct the college rally then?

547
00:32:37.791 --> 00:32:40.111
Will you be able to gather
a strong crowd by the afternoon?

548
00:32:40.794 --> 00:32:42.421
Hey! Parma!

549
00:32:42.838 --> 00:32:44.089
Will you be able to?

550
00:32:45.632 --> 00:32:49.803
It's been five years he's been hanging
around at the college.

551
00:32:50.387 --> 00:32:53.974
You must've done your PHD by now Dr. Parma

552
00:32:54.057 --> 00:32:55.897
or are you still languishing
in the first year?

553
00:32:56.685 --> 00:32:59.438
Dharma, you take care
of the college rally.

554
00:33:13.785 --> 00:33:15.913
Today you've lapped up even
the bitter gourd.

555
00:33:16.371 --> 00:33:17.891
That's cause you've cooked it so well.

556
00:33:18.415 --> 00:33:20.125
What's cooking in your head?

557
00:33:20.209 --> 00:33:22.336
My job is to eat. I can't cook!

558
00:33:22.503 --> 00:33:24.796
Don't try to fool me. Out with the truth.

559
00:33:25.297 --> 00:33:27.674
Why this non-stop smiling?

560
00:33:27.966 --> 00:33:28.967
Just like that!

561
00:33:29.051 --> 00:33:30.093
Liar!

562
00:33:30.260 --> 00:33:31.637
I swear on you.

563
00:33:31.720 --> 00:33:33.472
Keep lying!

564
00:33:33.972 --> 00:33:35.812
I'm not looking forward
to a long life, anyway.

565
00:33:48.195 --> 00:33:49.571
So what made him relent?

566
00:33:50.280 --> 00:33:52.950
Dad, one mango-sweet smile...

567
00:33:53.742 --> 00:33:55.619
and he melted just like that!

568
00:33:56.453 --> 00:33:58.622
- I'll be back.
- Wait...

569
00:33:59.331 --> 00:34:00.958
I'll stand guard.

570
00:34:01.667 --> 00:34:02.735
If he dares to come
into the ladies toilet,

571
00:34:02.759 --> 00:34:05.319
he'll get such a beating
that he won't be able to ever pee again.

572
00:34:05.504 --> 00:34:07.381
Ass!
I'll be back.

573
00:34:07.464 --> 00:34:08.590
Just be careful.

574
00:34:27.901 --> 00:34:29.461
What're you doing in the ladies toilet?

575
00:34:30.654 --> 00:34:31.822
Sorry...

576
00:34:32.906 --> 00:34:34.491
I messed up, forgive me.

577
00:34:34.658 --> 00:34:35.909
I'll kill you!

578
00:34:36.285 --> 00:34:37.286
Kill me?

579
00:34:37.619 --> 00:34:39.663
- But forgive me.
- Let go of my hand.

580
00:34:40.038 --> 00:34:41.918
Stop running like a headless chicken
and listen!

581
00:34:41.957 --> 00:34:43.417
Let go of my hand, you crazy creep!

582
00:34:43.500 --> 00:34:45.752
Not crazy... love-crazy.

583
00:34:45.836 --> 00:34:47.212
How dare you?

584
00:34:47.296 --> 00:34:49.464
Just the way you dared
to slap me in front of everyone!

585
00:34:51.383 --> 00:34:56.305
I dug my gun into your forehead
and you didn't even blink!

586
00:34:57.181 --> 00:34:58.765
Swear to god.

587
00:34:58.849 --> 00:35:00.827
I've seen such a dare devil attitude
for the first time!

588
00:35:00.851 --> 00:35:02.011
I've fallen in love with you.

589
00:35:02.227 --> 00:35:05.059
C'mon now forgive me
and become love-crazy!

590
00:35:09.735 --> 00:35:11.111
You still don't get it, do you?

591
00:35:11.195 --> 00:35:12.875
There's a full-tanker of blood in my body,

592
00:35:12.946 --> 00:35:15.091
drain it all out
but I'll keep asking you for forgiveness.

593
00:35:15.115 --> 00:35:17.284
- Have you seen my brothers?
- Very ugly, I must say.

594
00:35:17.451 --> 00:35:18.493
They'll make mince you!

595
00:35:18.744 --> 00:35:20.829
I'll settle their scores with them,
yours with you.

596
00:35:20.913 --> 00:35:22.664
Why? Have you forgotten the slap?

597
00:35:23.040 --> 00:35:24.208
Score settled!

598
00:35:24.291 --> 00:35:25.727
Your forgiveness remains,
at least settle that.

599
00:35:25.751 --> 00:35:28.504
Show this attitude at my house.

600
00:35:28.837 --> 00:35:33.008
If you've have the guts come to my house
and take my forgiveness.

601
00:35:36.053 --> 00:35:37.387
Let go!

602
00:36:02.246 --> 00:36:03.997
If we get caught together

603
00:36:04.122 --> 00:36:06.667
no one will believe
that I forced myself in...

604
00:36:06.750 --> 00:36:10.587
If word spreads, you'll be disgraced,

605
00:36:10.671 --> 00:36:12.756
your family will be disgraced.

606
00:36:13.549 --> 00:36:16.134
Forget about your father winning
the elections then.

607
00:36:17.010 --> 00:36:19.137
I'm saying it for your father's good.

608
00:36:20.722 --> 00:36:23.433
Don't scream, OK. I'm letting go.

609
00:36:47.833 --> 00:36:49.084
Hey, you silly lizard.

610
00:36:49.918 --> 00:36:52.880
The revolver, put it in.

611
00:36:55.632 --> 00:36:59.469
I'll come back...
to ask for forgiveness.

612
00:36:59.553 --> 00:37:00.679
What's happening inside,

613
00:37:00.762 --> 00:37:04.099
open up or I'll call the principal!

614
00:37:05.642 --> 00:37:07.019
Good morning, ma'am!

615
00:37:07.102 --> 00:37:08.353
Why had you locked the door?

616
00:37:08.437 --> 00:37:11.273
I didn't do it. A monkey had gotten in,
he must've done it.

617
00:37:11.356 --> 00:37:12.983
Don't argue. Move aside.

618
00:37:25.037 --> 00:37:27.956
Keep yourself free tonight, Lizard.
I'll come for your forgiveness.

619
00:38:09.331 --> 00:38:11.124
Bloody infidel!

620
00:38:11.208 --> 00:38:12.543
Why should I forgive?

621
00:38:14.169 --> 00:38:16.505
Catch him... catch him!

622
00:38:16.588 --> 00:38:18.632
Parma has broken inside.

623
00:38:18.966 --> 00:38:20.109
Jerk, you want to ask for forgiveness!

624
00:38:20.133 --> 00:38:21.552
What? He's really here!

625
00:38:41.154 --> 00:38:42.823
Ask us you jerk!

626
00:38:42.906 --> 00:38:44.575
We'll give you forgiveness.

627
00:38:49.580 --> 00:38:50.873
You're dead!

628
00:39:43.383 --> 00:39:44.551
Shadaab... enough!

629
00:39:45.219 --> 00:39:46.303
Elections.

630
00:39:46.386 --> 00:39:47.471
I'm not going to leave him.

631
00:39:47.638 --> 00:39:49.890
Think about Dad, elections...

632
00:39:49.973 --> 00:39:50.849
You go inside!

633
00:39:50.933 --> 00:39:52.267
Whack the jerk!

634
00:39:54.144 --> 00:39:55.938
Throw the ass outside...

635
00:40:11.495 --> 00:40:12.621
Turn off the light.

636
00:40:23.257 --> 00:40:24.383
Let's go.

637
00:40:24.967 --> 00:40:26.677
- Where to?
- Graveyard.

638
00:40:28.804 --> 00:40:30.347
Will you bury me dead or alive?

639
00:41:03.213 --> 00:41:05.340
Don't you touch me
or I'll really shoot you this time.

640
00:41:05.632 --> 00:41:06.967
But forgive me before that.

641
00:41:11.597 --> 00:41:13.557
Is it really that tough
to do such a simple thing?

642
00:41:14.141 --> 00:41:16.369
Today you're asking me for my forgiveness,
tomorrow it'll be my love.

643
00:41:16.393 --> 00:41:19.605
A story which can't be brought to its end
shouldn't be written in the first place

644
00:41:19.688 --> 00:41:20.874
and if at all one has started
writing it

645
00:41:20.898 --> 00:41:22.816
then all the pages
must be torn and burnt!

646
00:41:26.945 --> 00:41:29.698
My family will kill you
and yours will kill me.

647
00:41:29.907 --> 00:41:31.509
Is it my fault that you were born
a Muslim?

648
00:41:31.533 --> 00:41:32.701
Your fault, you infidel.

649
00:41:34.703 --> 00:41:35.703
Wimp!

650
00:41:35.913 --> 00:41:37.247
Don't call me a wimp!

651
00:41:38.040 --> 00:41:39.320
Then do as your heart desires...

652
00:41:40.584 --> 00:41:42.044
go on, don't feel shy.

653
00:41:48.050 --> 00:41:49.968
Fine, I forgive you.

654
00:41:50.135 --> 00:41:51.553
Do it with love...

655
00:41:51.720 --> 00:41:53.847
Accept it with my hatred,
or else buzz off!

656
00:41:53.931 --> 00:41:55.366
When can I come to get one with love?

657
00:41:55.390 --> 00:41:57.559
Whenever your heart desires a beating.

658
00:41:57.768 --> 00:41:59.019
And if my heart desires you.

659
00:42:01.522 --> 00:42:04.002
Then jump in front of a speeding train
with your heart and all.

660
00:42:05.609 --> 00:42:08.529
Long live, Aftab Qureshi!

661
00:42:09.719 --> 00:42:11.759
LONG LIVE AFTAB QURESHI
CAST VOTE ON COMPUTER SYMBOL

662
00:42:16.411 --> 00:42:19.248
Down with Surya Chauhan!

663
00:42:21.875 --> 00:42:27.840
<i>I look for you with new eyes, everywhere</i>

664
00:42:31.552 --> 00:42:37.432
<i>I find new sights, likewise, everywhere</i>

665
00:42:41.270 --> 00:42:46.817
<i>My heart's a flutter, I feel</i>

666
00:42:50.737 --> 00:42:56.201
<i>It's flirting with danger, I feel</i>

667
00:42:59.621 --> 00:43:04.668
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

668
00:43:04.751 --> 00:43:08.714
<i>Where are those flames?</i>

669
00:43:09.089 --> 00:43:14.303
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

670
00:43:14.428 --> 00:43:17.431
<i>Where are those pains?</i>

671
00:43:58.263 --> 00:44:00.516
- Zoya.
- Z... Zoya.

672
00:44:01.517 --> 00:44:03.185
Z... Zoya!

673
00:44:05.437 --> 00:44:06.605
But that is what I'm saying!

674
00:44:06.688 --> 00:44:08.106
Zoya!

675
00:44:08.649 --> 00:44:11.860
Yes absolutely correct.
Zoya!

676
00:44:13.654 --> 00:44:19.451
<i>The streets are swooning</i>

677
00:44:23.163 --> 00:44:29.044
<i>They're merging with you</i>

678
00:44:32.756 --> 00:44:35.926
<i>The cross-roads</i>

679
00:44:36.009 --> 00:44:39.763
<i>The mile-stones are calling for you</i>

680
00:44:42.641 --> 00:44:48.480
<i>My heart is tired of treading, I feel</i>

681
00:44:52.192 --> 00:44:57.281
<i>It's yearning to fly, I feel</i>

682
00:45:00.742 --> 00:45:06.039
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

683
00:45:06.164 --> 00:45:09.376
<i>What I aspire</i>

684
00:45:10.252 --> 00:45:15.299
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

685
00:45:15.382 --> 00:45:18.886
<i>Of my desire</i>

686
00:45:59.510 --> 00:46:05.057
<i>I'm blushed, I'm flushed
for the first time</i>

687
00:46:08.894 --> 00:46:14.858
<i>I'm breathing, I'm dreaming
for the first time</i>

688
00:46:18.612 --> 00:46:21.198
<i>These drops of fondness</i>

689
00:46:21.281 --> 00:46:23.367
<i>I savor the sweetness</i>

690
00:46:23.450 --> 00:46:27.246
<i>I am not me, no more</i>

691
00:46:28.497 --> 00:46:33.252
<i>My heart's changing
It's take, I feel</i>

692
00:46:38.006 --> 00:46:43.303
<i>It's turning my fate, I feel</i>

693
00:46:46.557 --> 00:46:51.937
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

694
00:46:52.020 --> 00:46:56.275
<i>The intoxication</i>

695
00:46:56.483 --> 00:47:01.280
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

696
00:47:01.363 --> 00:47:06.118
<i>The exhilaration</i>

697
00:47:06.201 --> 00:47:11.039
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

698
00:47:11.456 --> 00:47:15.794
<i>Where are those flames?</i>

699
00:47:15.878 --> 00:47:20.549
<i>Restless, I'm restless</i>

700
00:47:20.632 --> 00:47:25.387
<i>Where are those pains?</i>

701
00:48:27.157 --> 00:48:28.367
Parma...

702
00:48:30.327 --> 00:48:32.955
After we're married, OK?

703
00:48:34.790 --> 00:48:36.041
So let's get married.

704
00:48:37.167 --> 00:48:38.627
You'll marry me?

705
00:48:38.752 --> 00:48:40.712
Why? What's wrong with you?

706
00:48:42.047 --> 00:48:43.173
Don't sweet talk me!

707
00:48:43.507 --> 00:48:44.818
Spending a moment together
is so difficult,

708
00:48:44.842 --> 00:48:47.135
if we get married,
there'll be communal riots in town.

709
00:48:47.427 --> 00:48:48.762
So then forget about me,

710
00:48:49.012 --> 00:48:51.515
if you love me then accept me completely
with pride!

711
00:48:53.684 --> 00:48:54.852
Parma...

712
00:49:09.116 --> 00:49:10.218
What's the worst that can happen?

713
00:49:10.242 --> 00:49:11.493
They'll be upset initially...

714
00:49:11.785 --> 00:49:16.957
but once we're married they'll
have no choice but to accept it...

715
00:49:17.332 --> 00:49:18.500
If they don't?

716
00:49:18.625 --> 00:49:21.253
We'll run away.

717
00:49:21.503 --> 00:49:24.339
I'm not leaving my town Almore
to go anywhere.

718
00:49:25.048 --> 00:49:26.258
What does Almore have anyway?

719
00:49:26.967 --> 00:49:28.135
I'll take you to Delhi.

720
00:49:28.594 --> 00:49:29.845
OK, then to Mumbai?

721
00:49:29.928 --> 00:49:31.221
Become a heroine there!

722
00:49:31.555 --> 00:49:33.182
I'm staying right here to become an MLA.

723
00:49:36.185 --> 00:49:37.311
What?!

724
00:49:38.103 --> 00:49:41.523
Why are you laughing?

725
00:49:41.773 --> 00:49:43.942
I'll become a MLA one day.
Just watch!

726
00:49:44.818 --> 00:49:46.486
Get married first
and then become one...

727
00:49:46.778 --> 00:49:47.946
Will you convert to Islam?

728
00:49:48.030 --> 00:49:50.490
Cause I'm sure not marrying
an infidel and going to hell!

729
00:49:50.574 --> 00:49:52.159
Then I'll go with you to heaven.

730
00:49:52.326 --> 00:49:54.179
You're willing to give up
on your faith so easily?

731
00:49:54.203 --> 00:49:55.883
For you I'd give up any faith or religion.

732
00:49:57.164 --> 00:49:58.332
Please don't!

733
00:49:58.415 --> 00:50:03.337
Otherwise one day you'll give me up
this easily as well. I'm leaving.

734
00:50:05.547 --> 00:50:07.716
You meet me here
with a wedding dress tomorrow.

735
00:50:08.675 --> 00:50:10.385
Enough fooling around...

736
00:50:10.802 --> 00:50:13.388
we'll be hurting our families...

737
00:50:13.472 --> 00:50:14.723
I've decided...

738
00:50:15.140 --> 00:50:17.285
Tomorrow, I'm going to wait here
for you with the priest.

739
00:50:17.309 --> 00:50:20.187
If you don't turn up, forget about me.

740
00:50:52.511 --> 00:50:54.596
It's not an out. Bowl again!

741
00:50:56.139 --> 00:50:58.559
Look who is here! Our fielder.

742
00:50:58.642 --> 00:51:01.144
Not in the mood to field today, Tendulkar?

743
00:51:01.979 --> 00:51:03.564
OK, go ahead you can bat...

744
00:51:04.106 --> 00:51:07.192
If the Chauhans win, they'll make Almore
their personal property...

745
