Don't be stupid,

994
01:13:14.937 --> 01:13:16.480
Dadda will kill us.

995
01:13:16.647 --> 01:13:17.689
That's it?

996
01:13:17.981 --> 01:13:19.650
That's your bravado?

997
01:13:19.733 --> 01:13:21.360
Mom, are you drunk?

998
01:13:23.199 --> 01:13:24.613
Save me, I'm here.

999
01:13:24.696 --> 01:13:26.240
Your granddad's calling you. Come out.

1000
01:13:26.323 --> 01:13:28.075
Tell him I'll be
with him in a second...

1001
01:13:28.158 --> 01:13:32.746
If these men get a whiff,
they'll tear you to pieces.

1002
01:13:32.979 --> 01:13:34.699
<i>Hey, come on, come out</i>

1003
01:13:34.790 --> 01:13:36.166
Go on, I'll be out in a minute.

1004
01:13:37.376 --> 01:13:38.710
I said I'm coming, go on!

1005
01:13:44.299 --> 01:13:46.677
You go down,
I'll take care of her...

1006
01:13:46.969 --> 01:13:48.238
You don't bother I will fix her...

1007
01:13:48.262 --> 01:13:50.639
Parme!
Go down.

1008
01:13:53.058 --> 01:13:55.227
You're inviting big trouble, Mom.

1009
01:13:56.562 --> 01:13:57.604
Zoya!

1010
01:14:21.211 --> 01:14:22.254
Get this opened!

1011
01:14:22.337 --> 01:14:23.714
Open up or I'll break it down...

1012
01:14:29.469 --> 01:14:31.019
- Who is this?
- <i>Have you found Zoya?</i>

1013
01:14:31.096 --> 01:14:35.379
No, I found her phone
lying outside her room...

1014
01:14:35.767 --> 01:14:36.602
any news?

1015
01:14:36.685 --> 01:14:38.270
<i>No Uncle, we're still searching.</i>

1016
01:14:40.272 --> 01:14:41.732
She didn't leave a single clue.

1017
01:14:41.940 --> 01:14:42.941
A clue to what?

1018
01:14:43.233 --> 01:14:45.319
Clue to nailing the jerk she married.

1019
01:14:45.777 --> 01:14:47.529
Let's worry about Zoya first.

1020
01:14:49.573 --> 01:14:50.866
Did she worry about us?

1021
01:14:55.204 --> 01:14:58.874
Oh Allah! Please protect
my daughter from the enemy.

1022
01:15:00.125 --> 01:15:01.460
Where did you get this?

1023
01:15:02.336 --> 01:15:03.670
Who taught you to shoot?

1024
01:15:05.380 --> 01:15:07.216
I got carried away.

1025
01:15:07.508 --> 01:15:10.511
I swear I'll not kill your son, let me go.

1026
01:15:11.345 --> 01:15:13.013
You expect me to believe you?

1027
01:15:13.388 --> 01:15:15.140
My family will come to rescue me

1028
01:15:15.224 --> 01:15:17.059
they'll make you all weep tears of blood

1029
01:15:17.142 --> 01:15:18.352
you won't be spared either.

1030
01:15:18.602 --> 01:15:20.079
You think they'll embrace you with glee?

1031
01:15:20.103 --> 01:15:21.103
Of course!

1032
01:15:21.188 --> 01:15:22.948
Qureshis and Chauhans
are one and the same...

1033
01:15:23.899 --> 01:15:26.068
if you go back won't
they cut you to pieces?

1034
01:15:26.527 --> 01:15:27.527
Never.

1035
01:15:27.861 --> 01:15:28.981
I'm their blood after all...

1036
01:15:29.071 --> 01:15:30.322
every one's precious.

1037
01:15:30.989 --> 01:15:32.324
I'm warning you, let me go.

1038
01:15:32.574 --> 01:15:33.992
Let me go or I'll scream...

1039
01:15:34.576 --> 01:15:37.246
Shut up or I'll slap you!

1040
01:15:38.705 --> 01:15:39.706
Sit down.

1041
01:15:40.999 --> 01:15:42.543
Sit!

1042
01:15:47.714 --> 01:15:50.259
Punish Parma however you want

1043
01:15:50.592 --> 01:15:51.927
but don't desert him.

1044
01:15:52.302 --> 01:15:53.345
With you by his side

1045
01:15:53.554 --> 01:15:56.348
maybe there's hope for this animal
to transform into a human being.

1046
01:15:56.640 --> 01:15:59.810
Even god almighty cannot
make that bloody animal a human.

1047
01:16:00.102 --> 01:16:02.646
If he dies,
it will be in everyone's best interest!

1048
01:16:03.438 --> 01:16:04.857
Your love is not genuine either.

1049
01:16:05.065 --> 01:16:07.776
Had it been, you wouldn't have given up
on him so easily.

1050
01:16:08.360 --> 01:16:11.488
My love is genuine
and that's why I've come to kill him.

1051
01:16:11.572 --> 01:16:13.490
Dying or killing is easy.

1052
01:16:13.824 --> 01:16:16.827
You'll kill him,
his granddad will kill you.

1053
01:16:16.910 --> 01:16:17.786
End of story!

1054
01:16:17.870 --> 01:16:19.538
At least, then I'll die in peace.

1055
01:16:19.621 --> 01:16:20.998
What good is losing and dying?

1056
01:16:21.081 --> 01:16:23.083
Killing Parma is my victory.

1057
01:16:23.166 --> 01:16:24.793
Killing is not victory.

1058
01:16:25.502 --> 01:16:27.087
If you are really brave...

1059
01:16:28.297 --> 01:16:31.175
Try transforming this animal
into a human being.

1060
01:16:31.383 --> 01:16:33.260
Try winning him over...

1061
01:16:33.886 --> 01:16:35.179
that'll be victory.

1062
01:17:00.954 --> 01:17:03.624
He's the Imaam from the mosque,
Uncle

1063
01:17:04.124 --> 01:17:06.752
Come on, start talking.

1064
01:17:07.419 --> 01:17:09.004
I am a poor man, sir...

1065
01:17:09.213 --> 01:17:12.341
Parma bribed me and Mr. Chaubey
with Rs. 10,000 each.

1066
01:17:12.633 --> 01:17:16.929
In the name of god,
we got them married,

1067
01:17:17.513 --> 01:17:21.141
he'd threatened me,
that if I told anyone...

1068
01:17:21.225 --> 01:17:23.977
He'd just threatened you? I'll kill you!

1069
01:17:24.394 --> 01:17:26.897
Why bully me, if you have no control over
your own women...

1070
01:17:26.980 --> 01:17:28.023
Sohraab!

1071
01:17:28.440 --> 01:17:30.817
No point beating the Imaam.
Get the car.

1072
01:17:31.443 --> 01:17:32.843
Quddos, Fakhru, gather all the men!

1073
01:17:32.903 --> 01:17:35.822
Many small cities like Almore,
make one big India.

1074
01:17:36.365 --> 01:17:38.534
Almore grows, India grows.

1075
01:17:38.617 --> 01:17:40.619
It's progress would be India's progress.

1076
01:17:40.744 --> 01:17:45.749
As the new MLA, I'll work towards
a better future for Almore and for India.

1077
01:17:46.250 --> 01:17:47.751
I don't think like a pond frog...

1078
01:17:47.835 --> 01:17:49.753
those who do are no longer in office.

1079
01:17:49.837 --> 01:17:51.713
Dadda, Qureshis are coming.

1080
01:17:52.005 --> 01:17:54.216
Aftab Qureshi is personally coming
to congratulate you?

1081
01:17:54.299 --> 01:17:55.299
How does that feel?

1082
01:17:55.425 --> 01:17:57.719
Don't know what his agenda is,

1083
01:17:57.803 --> 01:17:59.429
but I'll have to welcome Qureshi anyway.

1084
01:18:00.222 --> 01:18:03.225
We're done here.
I have to prepare for his welcome.

1085
01:18:03.851 --> 01:18:04.852
Karma!

1086
01:18:05.060 --> 01:18:07.020
Santosh, Susheel cover the gate.

1087
01:18:07.104 --> 01:18:10.148
Birju, Gangu, Rawat, Chattar,
the terrace.

1088
01:18:10.232 --> 01:18:12.526
Moti, you and Prakash,
from the generator's side.

1089
01:18:12.651 --> 01:18:14.528
Get your weapons and into position,

1090
01:18:14.611 --> 01:18:16.091
the Qureshis will be here any moment.

1091
01:18:22.786 --> 01:18:23.829
Who is it?

1092
01:18:24.037 --> 01:18:25.581
<i>Mom! Open.
Quick!</i>

1093
01:18:28.166 --> 01:18:29.793
Hey! Get up!

1094
01:18:30.252 --> 01:18:32.379
The witch's family is here...

1095
01:18:32.462 --> 01:18:33.523
told you keeping her here
would be disastrous.

1096
01:18:33.547 --> 01:18:35.340
- You're so dead!
- Shut up!

1097
01:18:35.424 --> 01:18:36.675
- Leave her.
- Dad!

1098
01:18:36.925 --> 01:18:38.736
There'll be a lot of bloodshed,
just kick her out.

1099
01:18:38.760 --> 01:18:39.760
No.

1100
01:18:39.928 --> 01:18:41.263
They'll kill me and you.

1101
01:18:41.346 --> 01:18:43.640
This is all your doing,
now we must pay for it!

1102
01:18:43.724 --> 01:18:45.184
Parma, come quick!

1103
01:18:45.392 --> 01:18:46.435
Coming! You go ahead!

1104
01:18:46.768 --> 01:18:48.103
And get your pistol.

1105
01:18:48.187 --> 01:18:49.813
Yes, I'll get it.
Go now!

1106
01:18:51.190 --> 01:18:52.983
I'm going to tell Dadda
she's hiding here.

1107
01:18:53.066 --> 01:18:54.109
No, Parma!

1108
01:18:54.276 --> 01:18:56.028
This is your chance to make amends.

1109
01:18:56.320 --> 01:18:58.655
Save her life.
Don't tell anybody.

1110
01:19:01.158 --> 01:19:02.492
Parma, open the door!

1111
01:19:05.621 --> 01:19:07.206
Parma, swear on me... not a word!

1112
01:19:15.088 --> 01:19:16.006
Yes, Dadda...

1113
01:19:16.089 --> 01:19:17.799
The Qureshis are coming.
Stay in your room.

1114
01:19:18.091 --> 01:19:20.278
- Those jerks! I'll deal with them.
- I said, stay inside.

1115
01:19:20.302 --> 01:19:22.554
The situation's tricky...

1116
01:19:23.430 --> 01:19:26.183
don't make it worse, be practical.

1117
01:19:26.517 --> 01:19:28.099
We've won the elections.

1118
01:19:28.227 --> 01:19:30.145
No need for muscle-flexing anymore!

1119
01:19:30.979 --> 01:19:31.979
Listen...

1120
01:19:32.940 --> 01:19:35.025
You haven't brought
the girl here have you?

1121
01:19:35.108 --> 01:19:36.527
No Dadda, why would I?

1122
01:19:36.610 --> 01:19:39.154
That girl's chapter is over.

1123
01:19:39.238 --> 01:19:40.781
Ages ago.

1124
01:20:05.419 --> 01:20:07.139
MLA
SURYA CHAUHAN

1125
01:20:07.224 --> 01:20:09.104
Why did you drag my daughter
in to the election?

1126
01:20:09.351 --> 01:20:11.353
We fight like men,

1127
01:20:11.562 --> 01:20:13.021
we don't get women involved.

1128
01:20:13.188 --> 01:20:16.108
You're well aware
of your grandsons doing,

1129
01:20:16.191 --> 01:20:17.526
we'll deal with him later.

1130
01:20:17.609 --> 01:20:20.320
Where have you hidden my daughter?

1131
01:20:20.612 --> 01:20:21.905
Why'd we hide her?

1132
01:20:21.989 --> 01:20:23.615
Your grandson eloped with her.

1133
01:20:23.866 --> 01:20:28.453
You're publicly declaring that
she has eloped. Really shameless!

1134
01:20:28.537 --> 01:20:29.681
No, I still have some shame left,

1135
01:20:29.705 --> 01:20:31.832
that's why I've come here
to strangle her myself.

1136
01:20:31.915 --> 01:20:33.166
Hand her over.

1137
01:20:33.250 --> 01:20:35.043
I'll bury her alive right here!

1138
01:20:35.127 --> 01:20:37.480
She's impure now and doesn't even deserve
a grave in my house.

1139
01:20:37.504 --> 01:20:39.006
You've lost the elections,

1140
01:20:39.089 --> 01:20:42.426
instead of baseless accusations accept
defeat like a man.

1141
01:20:42.509 --> 01:20:44.819
If I've said she's not here,
it means she's not here.

1142
01:20:45.095 --> 01:20:46.972
You expect us to believe you?

1143
01:20:47.222 --> 01:20:49.183
A Chauhan doesn't lie...

1144
01:20:49.266 --> 01:20:51.518
we do things proudly,
openly for all to see...

1145
01:20:51.602 --> 01:20:53.896
she's not here.

1146
01:20:57.608 --> 01:20:58.608
Sohraab...

1147
01:20:59.219 --> 01:21:00.569
Shadaab, let's go!

1148
01:21:00.652 --> 01:21:02.362
Uncle we can't leave without
taking Zoya.

1149
01:21:02.446 --> 01:21:03.864
Zoya's dead for me!

1150
01:21:05.365 --> 01:21:06.533
Let's go.

1151
01:21:33.477 --> 01:21:34.937
I want to go home.

1152
01:21:37.147 --> 01:21:42.653
Let me go home.
Let me go.

1153
01:21:45.899 --> 01:21:47.779
Don't be afraid.
This is now your house as well,

1154
01:21:48.719 --> 01:21:50.077
no one will harm you here.

1155
01:22:19.731 --> 01:22:21.817
Mom!

1156
01:22:21.900 --> 01:22:23.402
Where are you taking her?

1157
01:22:23.485 --> 01:22:25.404
Parma! Jerk, you lied to me!

1158
01:22:25.487 --> 01:22:27.406
It's not his fault.
I was hiding her.

1159
01:22:27.489 --> 01:22:29.575
Mom, stay out of it.
Let Dadda handle this...

1160
01:22:29.658 --> 01:22:33.579
Parma married her.
She is our daughter-in-law now.

1161
01:22:33.662 --> 01:22:36.456
I've invested forty years in building
a political career,

1162
01:22:36.540 --> 01:22:39.334
it'll all be ruined if I accept
this girl as my daughter-in-law.

1163
01:22:40.502 --> 01:22:41.712
She will stay right here.

1164
01:22:41.795 --> 01:22:43.148
Mom let go of the gun,
you'll get hurt.

1165
01:22:43.172 --> 01:22:44.590
Don't be stupid, Parvati.

1166
01:22:44.673 --> 01:22:46.067
Only my rules will apply in this house.

1167
01:22:46.091 --> 01:22:47.217
Only on these eunuchs.

1168
01:22:47.843 --> 01:22:49.970
For my son, my daughter-in-law,
it'll be my rules.

1169
01:22:50.053 --> 01:22:51.930
Your rules! Your daughter-in-law!

1170
01:22:52.014 --> 01:22:53.557
I'll show you who decides.

1171
01:22:53.640 --> 01:22:55.517
End of this girl,
end of all problems.

1172
01:22:56.810 --> 01:22:58.339
Mom!

1173
01:23:03.150 --> 01:23:04.526
Zoya run!

1174
01:23:04.610 --> 01:23:05.986
Mom, you will be fine.

1175
01:23:13.493 --> 01:23:15.537
Parma! Amend your mistake.

1176
01:23:16.538 --> 01:23:17.581
Mom, don't talk...

1177
01:23:18.207 --> 01:23:20.334
Make amends, Parme.

1178
01:23:30.469 --> 01:23:31.821
That witch is responsible for this.

1179
01:23:31.845 --> 01:23:33.805
Go get her. She mustn't escape.

1180
01:23:36.642 --> 01:23:38.936
She's responsible for Parvati's death.

1181
01:23:39.019 --> 01:23:41.021
Go, bring her back alive.

1182
01:23:41.104 --> 01:23:42.773
I want to kill her with my own hands.

1183
01:25:12.321 --> 01:25:14.921
I am really exhausted, Bawra.
I don't feel like talking right now.

1184
01:25:14.990 --> 01:25:16.217
But listen, it's really important.

1185
01:25:16.241 --> 01:25:18.493
How often have I told you

1186
01:25:18.577 --> 01:25:20.430
to not to come into the brothel
during business hours.

1187
01:25:20.454 --> 01:25:22.623
Give me that sandal
and go to your room.

1188
01:25:22.706 --> 01:25:24.146
I am a free citizen of a free India.

1189
01:25:24.208 --> 01:25:27.044
Free citizen, my foot!

1190
01:25:28.962 --> 01:25:30.964
No one was really
into the performance today,

1191
01:25:31.548 --> 01:25:32.799
even their tips were a joke.

1192
01:25:33.133 --> 01:25:37.346
They just went on about
the Qureshis and Chauhans.

1193
01:25:37.638 --> 01:25:40.015
So did the Qureshis
actually go over to kill Parma?

1194
01:25:40.516 --> 01:25:42.267
God keep Parma safe,

1195
01:25:42.518 --> 01:25:43.810
the others can go to hell!

1196
01:25:44.186 --> 01:25:46.855
I've heard that Parma married Zoya.

1197
01:25:47.064 --> 01:25:48.774
I'm sure they're just rumors.

1198
01:25:49.399 --> 01:25:51.193
Darling, it's important...

1199
01:25:51.276 --> 01:25:52.528
Not now, Bawra.

1200
01:25:52.903 --> 01:25:56.281
Just hear me out...

1201
01:25:56.365 --> 01:25:59.117
- Parma is here, in your room.
- Really?

1202
01:26:00.035 --> 01:26:01.620
I knew it was all a rumor!

1203
01:26:01.912 --> 01:26:04.081
Parma's come back to his Chand...

1204
01:26:04.623 --> 01:26:06.959
No one knows,
not even Rukmani Aunty.

1205
01:26:07.459 --> 01:26:10.712
I secretly got him in
from the storage room's back door.

1206
01:26:11.672 --> 01:26:13.131
Bawra Darling,

1207
01:26:13.382 --> 01:26:15.092
what great news you have brought!

1208
01:26:15.342 --> 01:26:16.468
OK, now scoot!

1209
01:26:29.898 --> 01:26:33.151
Parma, my love!

1210
01:26:33.235 --> 01:26:35.070
Grand dad is busy fighting battles
outside,

1211
01:26:35.654 --> 01:26:37.865
while grandson is waiting for me.

1212
01:26:38.866 --> 01:26:40.385
OK, do whatever you want.
Just make it, quick.

1213
01:26:40.409 --> 01:26:41.410
Open your eyes!

1214
01:26:41.618 --> 01:26:44.454
Swear to god,
you're the only one who gets me all coy.

1215
01:26:44.538 --> 01:26:45.706
Baby, open your eyes.

1216
01:26:47.207 --> 01:26:48.750
Oh God! Another woman?

1217
01:26:48.834 --> 01:26:50.002
Keep her here.

1218
01:26:50.169 --> 01:26:52.409
- So they're not rumors, it's true.
- Don't let her escape.

1219
01:26:52.671 --> 01:26:54.673
- I'm expecting a client.
- Ask him to get lost!

1220
01:26:55.174 --> 01:26:56.675
Will you buy my new outfit for Eid?

1221
01:26:57.384 --> 01:26:58.844
Baby really! Don't tell anyone!

1222
01:27:05.475 --> 01:27:07.060
What've you done to my Parma?

1223
01:27:08.103 --> 01:27:09.354
Let me see your face.

1224
01:27:11.273 --> 01:27:12.524
Dear god!

1225
01:27:13.192 --> 01:27:15.152
You are beautiful indeed!

1226
01:27:38.509 --> 01:27:39.801
Wait!

1227
01:27:39.885 --> 01:27:43.472
Now that the son is here,
he'll light the pyre.

1228
01:28:10.791 --> 01:28:15.963
Even if Parvati's gone, you can still come
to me for anything,

1229
01:28:16.463 --> 01:28:17.463
understand?

1230
01:28:21.134 --> 01:28:22.594
Where did you bury that Muslim?

1231
01:28:22.678 --> 01:28:24.012
Don't touch me!

1232
01:28:24.513 --> 01:28:26.598
Mom's last wish was
for me to make amends...

1233
01:28:28.016 --> 01:28:29.977
protecting Zoya is now
my responsibility.

1234
01:28:32.354 --> 01:28:33.819
That Muslim is my responsibility.

1235
01:28:34.147 --> 01:28:39.069
Jerk, I'll set you ablaze
in your mother's pyre

1236
01:28:39.278 --> 01:28:42.155
then the two of you can keep playing

1237
01:28:42.239 --> 01:28:44.116
this game of responsibility for eternity.

1238
01:28:44.199 --> 01:28:46.201
I'm a true blooded Chauhan...

1239
01:28:46.577 --> 01:28:48.217
I can't turn back on my responsibilities.

1240
01:28:48.412 --> 01:28:50.789
One who favors a Muslim
is no longer a Chauhan,

1241
01:28:50.873 --> 01:28:53.125
decide, your lineage or your mother...

1242
01:28:53.292 --> 01:28:54.334
Mom.

1243
01:28:55.294 --> 01:28:56.753
Parma, put the gun down!

1244
01:29:00.465 --> 01:29:01.675
Don't do anything crazy.

1245
