1485
01:49:23.522 --> 01:49:24.898
Mom!

1486
01:49:26.400 --> 01:49:27.400
Zoya!

1487
01:49:30.988 --> 01:49:32.114
Happy Eid!

1488
01:49:33.073 --> 01:49:34.908
- Your father...
- Where is he?

1489
01:49:35.117 --> 01:49:38.829
- He'll slaughter you.
- Yeah right, Dad will slaughter me?

1490
01:49:38.912 --> 01:49:40.414
He's never raised his voice on me.

1491
01:49:41.832 --> 01:49:44.793
- Hey! Where did you get stuck now?
- Who got stuck where?

1492
01:49:45.169 --> 01:49:46.295
My husband.

1493
01:49:55.804 --> 01:49:56.972
Stay in my room for now.

1494
01:49:57.055 --> 01:49:58.265
Dad must be very angry,

1495
01:49:58.348 --> 01:50:01.101
I'll go pour some love on his hot temper,
cool him and then call you.

1496
01:50:01.185 --> 01:50:02.644
Come, Mom.

1497
01:50:16.617 --> 01:50:17.617
Dad!

1498
01:50:19.578 --> 01:50:21.246
How dare you come back?

1499
01:50:26.585 --> 01:50:29.087
That you all must've been missing me.

1500
01:50:30.339 --> 01:50:32.419
Because I know you'll pretend
to be angry at first...

1501
01:50:33.050 --> 01:50:36.512
then like always,
you'll forgive and embrace...

1502
01:50:37.304 --> 01:50:39.640
me and Parma.

1503
01:50:41.058 --> 01:50:43.685
I'm alive because of him, Dad...

1504
01:50:44.311 --> 01:50:47.064
his Mom sacrificed her life
to save me.

1505
01:50:48.232 --> 01:50:49.650
Dad, please accept him.

1506
01:50:49.858 --> 01:50:53.362
You've disgraced us,

1507
01:50:54.029 --> 01:50:57.783
people say Aftab Qureshi has betrayed
his religion, his community

1508
01:50:58.075 --> 01:50:59.660
and you want me to forgive you?

1509
01:51:00.452 --> 01:51:01.828
Embrace that infidel?

1510
01:51:03.121 --> 01:51:04.361
You want a gift for Eid, right?

1511
01:51:05.165 --> 01:51:07.167
I'll give you a gift.
Wait!

1512
01:51:07.251 --> 01:51:09.651
- What are you doing, she's your daughter!
- Get out of my way.

1513
01:51:10.045 --> 01:51:10.879
Dad!

1514
01:51:10.963 --> 01:51:12.803
Hey Dad, don't pull the trigger
or Mom is dead.

1515
01:51:12.840 --> 01:51:15.467
Parma, put the gun down.

1516
01:51:15.551 --> 01:51:16.631
Make him put it down first.

1517
01:51:16.677 --> 01:51:18.136
Dad, you're just scaring us right?

1518
01:51:18.220 --> 01:51:19.781
But I'm not trying to scare,
I'll pull the trigger for real...

1519
01:51:19.805 --> 01:51:21.265
Parma, let me handle this.

1520
01:51:21.348 --> 01:51:24.184
You say we're dead for you, right?
Fine so be it.

1521
01:51:24.268 --> 01:51:27.271
But don't harm her.
You put your gun down,

1522
01:51:27.354 --> 01:51:28.730
I'll put down mine as well.

1523
01:51:28.981 --> 01:51:31.859
Dad he really loves me a lot,
and he makes me very happy.

1524
01:51:32.734 --> 01:51:34.069
Zoya!

1525
01:51:35.237 --> 01:51:40.284
No, let them go!
You can't do this! Just wait...

1526
01:51:40.367 --> 01:51:42.202
- Qudoos Fakhru, go after them!
- Wait!

1527
01:52:06.894 --> 01:52:08.562
Zoya, let's go!

1528
01:52:52.022 --> 01:52:53.065
JAIPUR

1529
01:52:54.566 --> 01:52:57.069
Jaipur is safe and far away.

1530
01:53:20.217 --> 01:53:22.261
Don't worry.
I'll be back in two seconds.

1531
01:53:44.241 --> 01:53:46.243
A bottle of water
and a pack of biscuits please.

1532
01:53:46.952 --> 01:53:51.582
A bottle of water
and a pack of biscuits please.

1533
01:53:57.546 --> 01:53:58.547
Zoya?

1534
01:54:16.565 --> 01:54:17.649
You jerk!

1535
01:54:17.733 --> 01:54:19.359
Where's Zoya?

1536
01:54:19.443 --> 01:54:20.611
Where is she?

1537
01:54:27.201 --> 01:54:28.243
Parma!

1538
01:54:32.289 --> 01:54:34.249
- Parme!
- Take this witch away, finish her!

1539
01:54:34.333 --> 01:54:35.333
Zoya!

1540
01:55:55.080 --> 01:55:56.456
Zoya!

1541
01:56:08.844 --> 01:56:10.095
Zoya!

1542
01:56:21.023 --> 01:56:22.608
- You'd said two seconds...
- Sorry.

1543
01:56:42.961 --> 01:56:44.281
Parma, you jerk.
You won't escape.

1544
01:56:59.853 --> 01:57:02.439
Not there! Let's go up!

1545
01:57:09.238 --> 01:57:10.322
Quick!

1546
01:57:23.377 --> 01:57:26.088
Have you had a Happy Eid?
Got your Eid gift?

1547
01:57:26.922 --> 01:57:29.317
Lot of faith you have in your family.
Some good that has done.

1548
01:57:29.341 --> 01:57:32.052
Forget about sweets,
they didn't even offer water.

1549
01:57:32.302 --> 01:57:34.012
Chased the life out of us...

1550
01:57:34.096 --> 01:57:36.306
Thanks to them,
now even my family knows.

1551
01:57:36.390 --> 01:57:37.910
Now, you can celebrate your Happy Eid!

1552
01:57:41.562 --> 01:57:43.105
We should've stayed at the brothel.

1553
01:57:45.065 --> 01:57:46.942
Go on cry if you want,
don't be embarrassed.

1554
01:57:47.818 --> 01:57:48.819
I'm not crying.

1555
01:57:50.112 --> 01:57:51.798
It's these chemicals
that are making my eyes water.

1556
01:57:51.822 --> 01:57:52.822
Yeah right!

1557
01:57:52.990 --> 01:57:56.535
Your dad wanted to shoot you,
that wouldn't make you cry.

1558
01:57:57.870 --> 01:57:58.996
Yes that does make laugh.

1559
01:58:09.965 --> 01:58:11.675
Are the chemicals really bothering you?

1560
01:58:13.177 --> 01:58:14.219
Chemicals don't bother me.

1561
01:58:15.262 --> 01:58:16.722
I've always aced Chemistry.

1562
01:58:17.347 --> 01:58:20.142
In my first and second year,
scored a full hundred.

1563
01:58:21.059 --> 01:58:22.811
If I get a hundred again...

1564
01:58:23.103 --> 01:58:24.479
I will get a gold medal.

1565
01:58:25.480 --> 01:58:28.817
Your dad must have influenced
the principal and gotten you the hundreds.

1566
01:58:29.234 --> 01:58:30.736
Don't talk about Dad!

1567
01:58:39.870 --> 01:58:40.870
Sorry!

1568
01:58:42.039 --> 01:58:44.124
It's just that I've never met
a topper before.

1569
01:58:44.791 --> 01:58:47.586
It's unbelievable.
You are amazing.

1570
01:58:54.259 --> 01:58:56.261
I love chemistry.

1571
01:58:57.095 --> 01:59:01.141
The lab, the smell of these chemicals.

1572
01:59:02.935 --> 01:59:04.728
Do you even know what this is?

1573
01:59:05.145 --> 01:59:06.647
Copper Sulphate.

1574
01:59:08.732 --> 01:59:10.452
You're still in your first year,
aren't you?

1575
01:59:11.610 --> 01:59:13.250
How long have you been in the first year?

1576
01:59:15.322 --> 01:59:16.323
Five!

1577
01:59:17.115 --> 01:59:18.951
But now that you're here,
Ms. Gold medal...

1578
01:59:19.409 --> 01:59:20.702
make me clear my First Year?

1579
01:59:21.995 --> 01:59:23.163
Great!

1580
01:59:23.747 --> 01:59:26.100
Now I also have to bear the responsibility
of making you pass exams.

1581
01:59:26.124 --> 01:59:27.125
Of course!

1582
01:59:37.261 --> 01:59:39.555
Surya Chauhan! You lied to me!

1583
01:59:40.347 --> 01:59:42.724
That's a real Eid union.

1584
01:59:43.433 --> 01:59:45.769
Shut up! Put your guns down!

1585
01:59:46.103 --> 01:59:48.689
If these jerks stay alive

1586
01:59:48.897 --> 01:59:52.901
their love story will mark
the end of our political careers.

1587
01:59:53.443 --> 01:59:56.280
Let's nip this now,

1588
01:59:56.363 --> 01:59:58.323
before the flame of their romance spreads.

1589
01:59:58.407 --> 02:00:00.367
Together if we surround them,

1590
02:00:00.450 --> 02:00:02.170
they'll be cornered
and finished in minutes.

1591
02:00:02.202 --> 02:00:04.413
Let's go! Surround the building!

1592
02:00:04.580 --> 02:00:06.140
We'll head towards the Science section,

1593
02:00:06.164 --> 02:00:07.724
you guys come from the History section.

1594
02:00:08.584 --> 02:00:10.294
Another good has come out of our love,

1595
02:00:10.377 --> 02:00:12.137
even these enemies have formed
a partnership.

1596
02:00:12.379 --> 02:00:13.755
Parma, give me a gun.

1597
02:00:55.506 --> 02:00:56.506
Parma!

1598
02:00:57.424 --> 02:00:59.218
How dare you, Shadaab!

1599
02:00:59.551 --> 02:01:01.428
Zoya! Forget it, let's go!

1600
02:01:18.153 --> 02:01:19.863
- Parma, are you alright?
- I'm Fine! Fine!

1601
02:01:19.947 --> 02:01:21.156
Let's go!

1602
02:01:26.537 --> 02:01:27.537
Run!

1603
02:01:28.872 --> 02:01:30.165
You bloody traitor!

1604
02:01:34.753 --> 02:01:36.463
You shoot them from the other side.

1605
02:01:38.423 --> 02:01:40.092
They're in here, in this room!

1606
02:01:56.400 --> 02:01:58.068
They've gone up!

1607
02:02:02.781 --> 02:02:03.866
Damn it!

1608
02:02:04.324 --> 02:02:06.618
Has the entire Almore
come together to see us off?

1609
02:02:06.702 --> 02:02:08.954
Go home! It's not like
we are leaving for ever.

1610
02:02:09.037 --> 02:02:10.831
When you all have calmed down
we'll return.

1611
02:02:10.914 --> 02:02:12.249
Call the cops.

1612
02:02:12.332 --> 02:02:13.852
To kill us and declare
it an encounter death?

1613
02:02:13.876 --> 02:02:15.395
Your dad must have
filed a case against me,

1614
02:02:15.419 --> 02:02:17.299
claiming you're a minor,
that I've kidnapped you

1615
02:02:17.337 --> 02:02:18.463
and raped you!

1616
02:02:18.547 --> 02:02:20.382
We'll become 'breaking news'.

1617
02:02:21.300 --> 02:02:24.011
But don't worry,
I won't let them get to us.

1618
02:02:24.344 --> 02:02:25.971
There they are!

1619
02:02:29.975 --> 02:02:31.685
<i>Among the lawful</i>

1620
02:02:31.768 --> 02:02:33.187
<i>And the lawless</i>

1621
02:02:33.270 --> 02:02:34.813
<i>Those that were</i>

1622
02:02:34.897 --> 02:02:36.440
<i>Among the thousands</i>

1623
02:02:36.523 --> 02:02:38.692
<i>Love-rebels The Love-rebels</i>

1624
02:02:38.775 --> 02:02:41.695
<i>Where are they now?</i>

1625
02:02:42.362 --> 02:02:44.406
<i>Love-rebels</i>

1626
02:02:45.908 --> 02:02:48.368
<i>The Love-rebels</i>

1627
02:03:24.947 --> 02:03:26.823
Give me some bullets.

1628
02:03:27.991 --> 02:03:28.991
Quick!

1629
02:03:32.246 --> 02:03:33.413
Don't be stingy.

1630
02:03:33.497 --> 02:03:34.748
I've given you all I had left.

1631
02:03:41.998 --> 02:03:44.718
<i>Qudoos, call the rest of guys too.</i>

1632
02:03:44.858 --> 02:03:46.098
<i>Come upstairs.</i>

1633
02:04:05.863 --> 02:04:07.364
Parma...

1634
02:04:08.240 --> 02:04:09.741
how much do you love me?

1635
02:04:09.825 --> 02:04:10.993
This is not the time.

1636
02:04:11.076 --> 02:04:11.952
Tell me...

1637
02:04:12.035 --> 02:04:13.745
I can give up my life for you...

1638
02:04:13.996 --> 02:04:15.706
Can you take my life instead?

1639
02:04:16.748 --> 02:04:18.125
Have you lost it?

1640
02:04:18.792 --> 02:04:21.879
Instead of them killing us,
I'd rather we kill each other.

1641
02:04:21.962 --> 02:04:25.132
Didn't your mom always say,
what good is losing and dying?

1642
02:04:30.179 --> 02:04:32.598
Zoya, I'll kill these assholes in a jiffy.

1643
02:04:32.681 --> 02:04:34.075
In five minutes we'll get to
the station,

1644
02:04:34.099 --> 02:04:35.577
and in ten minutes we will be on a train.

1645
02:04:35.601 --> 02:04:36.801
We'll leave Almore far behind.

1646
02:04:36.852 --> 02:04:38.562
We'll go far away from your Dad,
my Dadda.

1647
02:04:38.645 --> 02:04:39.897
You become an MLA,

1648
02:04:39.980 --> 02:04:42.149
I'll open a shop,
we'll do something together...

1649
02:04:42.316 --> 02:04:45.777
There will also be kids.
A little Zoya, little Parma. Don't worry.

1650
02:04:47.112 --> 02:04:48.238
Forget kids

1651
02:04:48.322 --> 02:04:51.575
or we'll have to teach them
to find love within their community.

1652
02:04:51.867 --> 02:04:54.262
It'll be a mess all over again if they
fall in love outside the community.

1653
02:04:54.286 --> 02:04:55.787
We'll give them the freedom.

1654
02:04:55.871 --> 02:04:57.497
To love who ever
and how ever they want.

1655
02:04:57.581 --> 02:04:58.581
True love.

1656
02:05:06.340 --> 02:05:07.424
Pull the trigger.

1657
02:05:07.674 --> 02:05:10.135
I can't kill you, I love you.

1658
02:05:10.219 --> 02:05:12.221
- That's why I'm asking you to do it.
- No Zoya!

1659
02:05:12.429 --> 02:05:13.847
I want to die by love,

1660
02:05:13.931 --> 02:05:16.600
if they manage to kill us
then their hatred wins.

1661
02:05:17.559 --> 02:05:18.727
We're love-crazy

1662
02:05:19.603 --> 02:05:21.188
and we have to make love victorious.

1663
02:05:32.241 --> 02:05:33.450
Come on, pull the trigger!

1664
02:06:57.618 --> 02:06:58.618
Don't laugh!

1665
02:06:59.369 --> 02:07:00.829
Don't you laugh you jerk!

1666
02:07:26.188 --> 02:07:27.731
Uncle, they're dead.

1667
02:07:28.232 --> 02:07:29.912
That's the end of Parma and Zoya.
Let's go.

1668
02:07:47.209 --> 02:07:49.419
<i>You're a bloody fool!
Your father is a bloody fool!</i>

1669
02:07:49.503 --> 02:07:50.939
<i>Your father's father is a bloody fool!</i>

1670
02:07:50.963 --> 02:07:52.130
<i>Your father is an ass!</i>

1671
02:07:52.214 --> 02:07:53.465
<i>You are an ass, you idiot!</i>

1672
02:07:53.549 --> 02:07:55.467
<i>You're the world's
biggest lizard you idiot!</i>

1673
02:07:55.551 --> 02:07:58.929
<i>You're a dog! Your father is a dog!
You are a mad dog.</i>

1674
02:07:59.012 --> 02:08:02.850
<i>You are a witch!
Your mother is a bloody fool.</i>

1675
02:08:04.476 --> 02:08:08.939
<i>Not of the earth, nor of the sky
The Love-rebels</i>

1676
02:08:10.065 --> 02:08:13.694
<i>Infinite unto themselves
The Love-rebels...</i>

1677
02:08:13.777 --> 02:08:15.863
PARMA
ZOYA

1678
02:08:16.488 --> 02:08:18.073
<i>Among the lawful</i>

1679
02:08:18.156 --> 02:08:19.491
And the lawless,

1680
02:08:19.575 --> 02:08:21.034
<i>Those that were</i>

1681
02:08:21.118 --> 02:08:22.619
<i>Among the thousands</i>

1682
02:08:22.703 --> 02:08:24.329
<i>Love-rebels</i>

1683
02:08:24.413 --> 02:08:25.664
<i>The Love-rebels</i>

1684
02:08:25.747 --> 02:08:28.917
<i>Where are they now?</i>

1685
02:08:29.001 --> 02:08:30.627
<i>Love-rebels</i>

1686
02:08:32.004 --> 02:08:35.174
<i>The Love-rebels</i>

1687
02:08:35.257 --> 02:08:37.134
<i>Among the stars</i>

1688
02:08:37.217 --> 02:08:38.552
<i>Among legends</i>

1689
02:08:38.635 --> 02:08:40.137
<i>Those that were found</i>

1690
02:08:40.220 --> 02:08:41.430
<i>in poets' renditions</i>

1691
02:08:41.513 --> 02:08:43.140
<i>Love-rebels</i>

1692
02:08:43.223 --> 02:08:44.683
<i>The Love-rebels</i>

1693
02:08:48.187 --> 02:08:51.940
LOVE-REBELS
